# LinkLine Chat

LinkLine is a lightweight anonymous one-on-one chat app made with Node.js, Express, and Socket.IO.

Features:
- One-on-one anonymous chat without sign-in
- Emoji support, numbers, normal text, and image sharing
- A chat code that works like a phone-number-style connection ID
- Share link button for easy joining
- Live room updates and typing indicators

## Run locally

1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
2. Start the server:
   ```bash
   npm start
   ```
3. Open:
   ```bash
   http://localhost:3000
   ```

## How it works

- Click "Create new chat" to generate a new private room.
- You will get a 6-digit room code and a share link.
- Send the code or the share link to the person you want to message.
- Anyone who enters the same code joins the same private chat room.

## Notes

This is a demo app built for local development. The room data lives in memory, so chats reset when the server restarts.
